window.R3_META={"source_stations": "City of Vancouver Open Data: rapid-transit-stations (22 points, EPSG:26910). TOA = within 800 m of a station point; see toa_method.", "toa_method": "TOA derivation. Stations: City of Vancouver open data 'rapid-transit-stations' (22 points, EPSG:26910).\nRule applied: a site is in a transit-oriented area if any part of it lies within 800 m of a station point\n(Transit-Oriented Areas Designation By-law 14090 / Bill 47 prescribed radius for a rapid-transit station).\nReported per site: nearest station, distance from the nearest point of the parcel, distance from the centroid,\nand the tier band (<=200 m, <=400 m, <=800 m). Parcels whose nearest and centroid distances straddle 800 m are flagged.\nNOT IN SOURCE: the enacted By-law 14090 polygon geometry. This is a circle-radius reconstruction from station points,\nnot the by-law map, and the by-law's own boundaries follow parcel lines rather than a true circle.", "source_parcels": "City of Vancouver Open Data: property-parcel-polygons (GeoJSON export, EPSG:26910)", "source_zoning": "City of Vancouver Open Data: zoning-districts-and-labels (GeoJSON export, EPSG:26910, dataset modified 2026-06-29)", "processed": "2026-09-18", "parcels_total": 99631, "r3_parcels": 5697, "method": "Derivation method (stated in output, quoted in UI):\n- Edges: polygon simplified 0.25 m, consecutive near-collinear edges (<8 deg) merged. Edges <3 m ignored for classification (corner chamfers).\n- Each edge probed along its outward normal from the midpoint, up to 80 m, for the nearest other parcel.\n    gap < 0.5 m  -> interior (shared) boundary\n    0.5 <= gap < 10.1 m -> lane      (ZDB s.2 lane/street distinction, 10.1 m threshold per brief)\n    10.1 <= gap <= 80 m -> street\n    no parcel within 80 m -> open (park / water / unknown) - flagged, not counted as frontage\n- Corner: >=2 street edges meeting at a vertex.  Frontage on a corner: shortest street edge (ZDB s.10.26.1(b)).\n- Mid-block frontage: the single street edge. Two non-adjacent street edges: double-fronting, frontage = shorter, flagged.\n- Depth: extent of polygon measured perpendicular to the frontage edge.\n- Irregular: area / minimum rotated bounding rectangle area < 0.85.\n- Adjacency: R3 parcels sharing >= 1.0 m of boundary.\n- Street sides shorter than 6 m are ignored for frontage when a longer street side exists (flagged street_stub_ignored)."};
